  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening institutional disaster preparedness in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With support of ERCS long term partners Netherlands Red Cross (NLRC) and Danish Red Cross (DRC), aim to make an impact in terms of strengthening institutional capacities, linkages and harmonization for key Disaster Risk Management (DRM) actors in Ethiopia, with focus on Anticipatory Action (AA) and Early Response (ER), both on national level, as well as on regional and woreda levels in Tigray, Somali and Afar regions. Support to Rapid Response Mechanisms (RRM) is also targeted by this action.</narrative>
  </description>
